{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_caper_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_caper_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"快乐之地","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_caper_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"5791f8d86559204272227705c9f4cc9427f7f94577d681573e89b741b6db18fe","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"跃跃来到多索雷斯寻找真正快乐的地方，却发现在这座“享乐之都”中，“快乐”有着不一样的诠释。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头晕的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我连续完成了十次“香槟杯晃晃晃”没吐出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"目眩的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我连续完成了二十次“背带裤摇摇摇”，也没吐出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，好的。两位游客，把你们的票券交上来，我会帮你们兑换抽奖机会哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看......完成十次“香槟杯晃晃晃”和二十次“背带裤摇摇摇”，总共可以抽奖三次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，请抽奖，祝你们好运~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头晕的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果中了一等奖，我要买下街对面的那幢二层小楼，这样每天一下楼就能来游乐厅了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头晕的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过拿个四等奖也行呀，那可是盒牌工业最新款的游艇，卖出去至少能还清欠“利齿帮”的保护费......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头晕的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已经把老妈的店铺抵押给他们了，可还差一点钱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"目眩的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可不敢做那些美梦，别又是“谢谢参与”就行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"目眩的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要能中奖，就不枉我强忍着呕吐感，坚持摇了二十次......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头晕的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"出了出了，快看看中了什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"目眩的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我现在还是有点眼花，看不清楚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，这可真不得了，你们的运气可真好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恭喜二位，这是今日特别大奖——“再来一百次”体验券！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头晕的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今日特别大奖？“再来一百次”？也就是说，我还能再抽奖一百次？太棒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，那多没意思啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"目眩的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈，不管怎么说，这一定是我中的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头晕的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我中的！你滚开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，不要争抢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“再来一百次”的意思是，你们可以再免费体验“香槟杯晃晃晃”或者“背带裤摇摇摇”一百次！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二位将会共享一百次机会，够你们玩个痛快了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头晕的游客&目眩的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！呕——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，还好我躲得快，差点吐我一身！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思啦，这位招待大姐，让你睡了这么久......你的工作服我完好无损地还给你了！换班！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可那两个人好像一点也不喜欢我准备的特别大奖啊，来游乐厅不就是为了玩吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能不要钱玩个够，这都不乐意，真怪......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，来一杯“双重日出”特调。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了红毛，别装模作样了，我可没跟你约定过这么土的接头暗号。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是真的想点一杯尝尝。那些收保护费的家伙都人手一杯，有那么好喝吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我“下班”了，你等这位招待大姐醒过来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那算了......还是交换情报要紧，我们找个方便说话的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，搞清楚那帮收保护费的人的底细了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我跟在几个人后面，找到了他们的老巢......比想象中的要麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些收保护费的，他们背靠的是这片街区最大的帮派——“利齿帮”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我们要想把他们全部从游乐厅里赶出去，就意味着要和整个帮派作对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准确地说，我们要想在这片街区待着，就得遵守“利齿帮”的规矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，那正好，反正我最擅长的就是破坏规矩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......卡莉，咱们别管他们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算他们继续留在游乐厅里收保护费，我们也能玩得很开心，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要别找我们要钱，也不是非要把他们都赶出去吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"红毛，我和你说过的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来多索雷斯，就是为了找一个真正快乐的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然在游乐厅里玩确实很快乐，但总有人来破坏它的乐趣，我看不惯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以不让人过得安稳快乐来要挟别人，并以此获利的家伙，最可恶了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是就是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我是老大，肯定不会让我的手下做这种事的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们就去搞定他们的头领吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂！不管他们头儿是退伍军人还是市长的人，反正只要把他打服就行了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你怎么还是这么鲁莽，就不能用聪明点的办法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡莉，我见过那家伙。我以我军旅生涯中获得的所有荣誉向你保证，只要是单挑，他肯定打不过我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这还得感谢你当年把我“送”去参军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）可如果他真是市长的人，就算你打赢了，事后不还是会有人找你算账吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没事，我还以为你一直因为那事儿记恨着我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是我把你骗上招兵的车，你估计还能做几年街区老大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗐，说什么呢，我不怪你。我都想明白了，当年要是没上那辆车，我也不会来到多索雷斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是没上那辆车......我这辈子，估计就只能做个贫民窟街区的老大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贫民窟有什么不好？我倒宁可还生活在那片街区里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在那双红手套之下，跃跃一直都能感受到源石结晶的触感。\n她本以为自己已经习惯，但总有一些时刻，让她无法忽视它的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算啦，现在咱们也都没得选了呀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"*玻利瓦尔俚语*，什么人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......是你这小崽子把罐子踢到我脸上的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是我，怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我问你，你是不是找刚才那个卖气球的老爷爷要保护费来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"关你什么事儿？我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别和他废话了，卡莉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，这一拳可真狠！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......红毛，你在干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，你为什么要翻这家伙的口袋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干什么？当然是把他收的钱都拿走啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，那记得还给卖气球的老爷爷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡莉，这些钱可不全是从那个老爷爷那里抢来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了行了，你别这么看着我。我拿这些钱，找他买几个气球，行了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来我们先分头行动吧，我要去办点事儿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，好啊，那我们就先各干各的呗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"红毛那家伙......一整天都没见到人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他应该把那些钱还给老爷爷了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，随他去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......卡莉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么蹲在这里？还有这么多空啤酒罐子......你这是喝了多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，是啊，我也不知道我喝了多少......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你知道吗，以前在贫民窟的时候......我老爹得擦二十双皮鞋，才舍得给自己买一罐冰啤酒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你受什么刺激了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刺激？哈哈，在多索雷斯，我每一天都在受刺激......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡莉......你见到了吧，今天我一拳就干倒了一个小喽啰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"光他今天收的保护费，就可以买这么多......这么多啤酒......凭什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"红毛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是我们应该拿的钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，说是这么说......可我们要的快乐，不就是有花不完的钱吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡莉，等我们打倒了“利齿帮”的头领......我们来当老大吧，我们一起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们也能收保护费，我们也能有花不完的钱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到时候，我可以给老爹换个新房子，就买在酒馆旁边，他想喝多少喝多少！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也可以把你妈接过来，在这里开个大工厂！哈哈，肯定够气派！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是这样的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_windows"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的家？那......妈妈呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妈妈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卡莉，我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，妈妈......我很想你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你过得好不好？那些坏家伙没再来收保护费吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妈妈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，我一直没写信给你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在找一个地方，一个真正快乐的地方......能把你也接过来，我们一起生活......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会有人赶我走，也不会有人砸你的工作间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得了矿石病，但我也不会给你增加负担......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我到现在也没找到这样的地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妈妈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，卡莉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妈妈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"砸锅卖铁，我也要把你治好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，妈妈，别这么说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妈妈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只要你快乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么说......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更希望......你也快乐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G08"},{"type":"narration","text":"第二天"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，谁教你这么写的？语气太冲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应该这样，在开头写上“尊敬的头领”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不行，字迹太潦草了，重写！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，然后再写上时间和地点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“下个星期五晚上七点，在你们的据点。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，我知道接下来要写什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“你等着，我来找你单挑。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重来，最后一句写——“不知您有没有时间？我有事想找您面谈。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡莉，我不懂啊，这可是一封挑战书，我们有必要对他那么礼貌吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来好像我们多怕他似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他要是真觉得我们怕他，那才好玩呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，听你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那到时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到约定时间了，我就先去游乐厅里制造点小混乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到时候他们的人都被我引过来，你就趁他们据点防卫空虚，去找他们的头领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你应该打得过他吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那当然！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就准备好了武器，哼，我告诉你，那可是好宝贝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等事成之后，我们就能成为“利齿帮”的头领，成为游乐厅的头领......说不定，还能成为多索雷斯的头领！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这家伙，也太乐观了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就不怕我再一次把你骗得团团转？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......老实说，刚和你再见面时，我是想过狠狠揍你一顿，让你也尝一尝我当兵时吃的那些苦头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我又转念一想，你脑子比我好，又是老相识......当朋友总比当仇人好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我很确定。卡莉，选择跟着你混，真的没错！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等事成之后再这么说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可别搞砸咯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......红毛那家伙，一聊起劲了可真是没完没了。他妈妈难道没告诉他十点之前要上床睡觉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且他对我们的作战计划也太有信心了，居然能睡得那么香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......要是真的按照原计划来，他肯定当不上什么头领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，大概他都没法活着离开“利齿帮”的老巢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，挑战书已经发出去了......既然要捣乱，就痛快地大闹一场吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，让这些多索雷斯人见识见识什么才是真正的快乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找找......红毛要带过去的武器，应该就放在这里吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，没错，这样肯定会更好玩的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，还得预订个好位置。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，您好，请问是希鲁斯空中饭店吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头晕的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"票券，我的票券呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头晕的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我好不容易完成了二十次“香槟杯晃晃晃”，有人偷了我的票券！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"手忙的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的包！我的包！怎么飞到吊灯上去了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脚乱的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么......谁把爆米花糖浆洒在地上了？！你们赔我新买的签名版球鞋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"请大家保持秩序！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"游乐厅有非法闯入者，请大家保持冷静，听从我们的指挥有序疏散！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"室内广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（女声）噔噔噔~各位客人晚上好，请按照安全指示，移步游乐厅门前广场，我们为大家准备了小礼品~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"室内广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（女声）记得检查好自己的墨镜、手表、高跟鞋，千万不要有东西遗落在游乐厅内，如果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"室内广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（男声）你这家伙，怎么闯进——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"室内广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（击打声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"室内广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（女声）咳咳，总而言之，祝大家有个快乐的夜晚~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头晕的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小礼品？是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"手忙的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不知道啊，去看看吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脚乱的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你没长眼吗？别踩我的鞋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，别堵在这儿，都挪动挪动，赶紧去外面占个好位置！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（吹口哨示意）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......接下来就看我的了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g1_dossolesstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"手忙的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这么长时间了，哪有什么小礼品......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脚乱的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啧，游乐厅的工作人员呢？就让我们在外面干等着？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"对，我跟着那家伙追出来了，可门口人太多了，找不到她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说，老大那边有情况？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别心急嘛，时间也差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......五，四，三，二，一，好戏开场咯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是你这家伙开着货车闯进我这里来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"货车一头扎进了“利齿帮”的老巢，车屁股却还露在外面。\n还算是个有气势的出场，红毛心想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，原本这间破房子就漏雨，这下连风都挡不住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找事儿？你把我的迎客厅给撞烂了，不打算给我个解释？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（什么情况？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不是说好的单挑吗？怎么这里还有这么多人？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搞什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不管了......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"红毛默不作声地打开货车后厢。\n那架他从老战友那儿搞到手的源石火炮，在战场上，总是能精准地把敌人们炸得血肉横飞。\n它绝对算得上是大杀器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个人，还是一群人，没什么区别......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"红毛想起了跃跃的嘱托。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那时，他还不太理解跃跃为何把“大杀器”讲得像小糖果一样。\n然而，当货厢打开之后......他以为自己看错了，揉了揉眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*玻利瓦尔俚语*！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"红毛终于理解了。\n那架原本应该存在的源石火炮消失不见了，取而代之的却是一些不知从哪里来的彩色纸箱子。\n他看到了纸箱子上印的卡通图案，封口的胶带上还写着“欢乐时光”的字样。\n他还看到了定时器与被点燃的引线，更要命的是，那引线即将烧到尽头......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一束束礼炮冲天而去，在夜空中绽放。\n花簇形的，爱心形的，羽兽形的......刹那间，烟花点缀着多索雷斯的夜空，在天上映出酒绿灯红。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g1_dossolesstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头晕的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"目眩的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，怎么样？够精彩吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要准备这么气派的烟花秀，可不简单哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"目眩的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么啊，这就是所谓的小礼品？吵死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头晕的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是，也太吵了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"手忙的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别这么说啊，烟花很好看啊，可惜好多都被高楼挡住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"手忙的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不提前通知，安排更好的观景点呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"目眩的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀算了，无聊无聊，我们能不能回游乐厅里了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真不理解这些多索雷斯人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要抬起头，每个人都能看见一点烟花......这难道还不够棒吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还在贫民窟的时候，每次城市里放烟花，妈妈都会喊我一起看......那是我们也能分享到的快乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......无所谓啦，他们不懂就算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，红毛那边......他们一定会很喜欢这份惊喜的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"narration","text":"几天后"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"让一让，让一让！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，好大的阵仗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多挂着花束和气球的车，车牌号还都是连着的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"忽然，车队中的一辆车驶离队伍，停在跃跃的身边。\n驾驶室的车门打开，下来了一个熟悉的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡莉！我可算见到你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天之后你去哪儿了，连最爱的游乐厅也不去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？看上去也忙得很呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新座驾不错哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，这是老大的车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦对了，你还不知道吧？我已经加入“利齿帮”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊，原来是烟花......居然是烟花！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完了......全完了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊喜的女子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天呐！甜心，好棒的烟花秀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊喜的女子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我真没想到，我还以为你又要打打杀杀的......原来你是想给我准备一个惊喜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊......没错！我可是筹划了很久呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你帮我一起准备的，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？对、对......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我的宝贝，你快点去换身衣服吧。一会儿，咱们去吃顿难忘的晚餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊喜的女子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！甜心，我很期待哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......请问......还需要我做什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，已经足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这家伙，真是让我刮目相看啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......不......对不起......我会想办法帮您把墙补好的！我一定会赔偿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赔偿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还想赔偿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为我办了件大事儿，我怎么会让你赔钱呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本我正愁什么时候求婚呢，哼，看来就是今天了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来人，去帮我订全多索雷斯视野最好的餐厅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”小弟","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"老大！希鲁斯空中饭店打来电话了，问我们预订的位置还要不要留！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？已经预订了？是你订的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，也许......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以啊，小子。我记住你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齿帮”头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，备车！我现在就去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天晚上，那女孩对烟花秀赞不绝口，然后......老大就求婚成功了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大喜出望外，当场就要拉我入伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的婚礼就定在今天晚上。这个车队，就是前往婚礼现场的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢......祝贺祝贺，那不是挺好的嘛，我的作战计划很成功啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，绝对不会更成功了，真没想到你居然有这样的鬼点子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，说真的，当时我紧张死了！你如果在旁边，肯定能听到我的汗珠落在地上的声音！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，既然你加入了“利齿帮”，那就早点当上老大，别让小弟们再收保护费了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个嘛......咱们不说这个了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，上车吧！我带着你，咱们一起加入“利齿帮”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算啦，没什么意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就算要去，也是去捣乱，肯定不会受欢迎的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我已经打算要离开多索雷斯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡莉，只要我们加入了“利齿帮”，游乐厅就能随便进，不会再有人来骚扰我们了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么了，卡莉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的多索雷斯......不就是你要找的“快乐之地”吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跃跃","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我觉得这里没有我要找的快乐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"忽然，婚车上挂着的庆典气球都被放飞，缓缓地升上天空，在孩子们的欢呼声中，所有人的注意力都被吸引了过去。\n等红毛回过神时，跃跃已经消失得无影无踪了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
